   bundled here solely for personal learning and porting research. Any commercial
   redistribution is prohibited.
4. All **Pokémon-related IP** belongs to Nintendo / Game Freak / The Pokémon
   Company. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Nintendo.
5. This project is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind; the author is
   not liable for any damages arising from its use.
